# Commit identity

Never run `git config` for `user.name` or `user.email`.

For every commit set:

- `GIT_AUTHOR_NAME` / `GIT_COMMITTER_NAME` = `qwts`
- `GIT_AUTHOR_EMAIL` / `GIT_COMMITTER_EMAIL` = `91036491+qwts@users.noreply.github.com`

Refuse to commit if git would otherwise use a macOS full name or a `*.local` / `*.lan` hostname email. Do not add `Co-authored-by` trailers with those identities.
